# Phase 1 of madgraph-ttbar2j-split: matrix-element code generation only.
#
# `output` writes the process directory as Fortran source and stops. The
# Fortran build is then driven explicitly by the phase's make step, so that
# all compilation lands inside this measured window rather than inside the
# event-generation one (which is what `launch` would do).
#
# Physics must stay identical to tasks/madgraph-ttbar2j-lhe — only the
# measurement boundary differs between the two tasks.
set automatic_html_opening False
generate p p > t t~ j j
output /work/proc_pp_ttbar
